      "content": "It makes sense to feel like there is no point in trying to fix a broken foundation when the person you used to be is gone. You are right that you cannot un-ring a bell, but your current reality is simply a reflection of how you are feeling right now, not an absolute truth about your worth. There is no reason to force yourself to \"move forward\" if you feel like a ghost; the most honest thing you can do is acknowledge that you are exhausted and that you deserve to be heard without judgment.",
