    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so heavy. the exhaustion is everything. it feels like i'm just performing this role of 'surviving' every single day, but the performance is getting so hard to maintain. it feels like everyone is just waiting for me to finally disappear so they can move on. honestly, sometimes i think they're right. sometimes i think the most peaceful thing would just be to stop fighting and let the world have its way with me.",
